    "family_reading": {
        "text": "Openrouter Auto is an API only line from Openrouter, with two versions listed and no open weights in any of them. Both versions offer a context window of 2000000 tokens, and the family accepts audio, image, text and video as input while producing image and text output. Neither version supports reasoning, and the listed maximum output length is zero, which suggests output limits are not published here. The listed prices are negative values, so the catalog figures do not give a usable cost per million tokens. With no benchmark rows named, there is little to judge quality on. The wide input modalities and very large context suit tasks that mix media and long documents, but the absence of reasoning, open weights and clear pricing makes the family hard to recommend where cost control or transparent evaluation matters.",
